{"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/openapikit\/documentconfiguration"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"OpenAPIKit supports some additional Encoder\/Decoder configuration above and beyond"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"what the Encoder or Decoder support out of box."}],"sections":[],"topicSections":[{"generated":true,"title":"Type Properties","anchor":"Type-Properties","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OpenAPIKit\/documentation\/OpenAPIKit\/DocumentConfiguration\/versionMapKey"]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OpenAPIKit\/documentation\/OpenAPIKit"]]},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"kind":"symbol","metadata":{"symbolKind":"enum","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"enum"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"DocumentConfiguration"}],"externalID":"s:10OpenAPIKit21DocumentConfigurationO","roleHeading":"Enumeration","role":"symbol","modules":[{"name":"OpenAPIKit"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"DocumentConfiguration"}],"title":"DocumentConfiguration"},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"DocumentConfiguration","kind":"identifier"}],"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Overview","anchor":"overview","type":"heading","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"To instruct OpenAPIKit to decode OpenAPI Standards versions it does not"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"natively support, set "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"userInfo[DocumentConfiguration.versionMapKey] = [\"3.5.0\": OpenAPI.Document.Version.v3_1_1]"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"That will cause OpenAPIKit to accept OAS v3.5.0 on decode and treat it as"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the natively supported v3.1.1. This fe